'Cloud MonitorVerifier puts plan.system_prompt and practice lessons in payload["system"]. claude_cli_transport ignores that field and supplies only the fixed CLI_SYSTEM_PROMPT. The user-message conversion does not carry system text either. Thus changing from API to subscription changes the monitor instructions. Main has the same transport implementation, but lacks this active plan-system producer, so the live finding is scoped to cloud-sims.',
